---
title: "admin_dashboard (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: check authenticated session
    q_auth --> q_error_unauth: session invalid
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: user is not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_load: user is admin
    q_load --> q_render: fetch members, teams, leaders, generation_roles from DB
    q_render --> q_action: render dashboard with all management sections
    q_action --> q_dispatch: admin selects action (edit member, manage team, set leader, manage roles, delete member)
    q_dispatch --> q_action: action completed, refresh dashboard
    q_dispatch --> [*]: admin exits dashboard
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return unauthorized error
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return forbidden error

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-001: Dashboard access is restricted to admin users only
        INV-002: UI-based access control must match server-side authorization
    end note

    note right of q_dispatch
        INV-003: Each dashboard action must enforce its own authorization check server-side
    end note
